### Get basket by username
GET {{Basket_HostAddress}}/john_doe
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Access_Token}}

###

### Upsert (create/update) basket
POST {{Basket_HostAddress}}/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Access_Token}}

{
  "userName": "john_doe",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "productName": "Laptop",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 55000.00
    }
  ]
}

###

### Upsert (create/update) basket
POST {{Basket_HostAddress}}/
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Access_Token}}

{
  "userName": "john_doe",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "productName": "Laptop",
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 55000.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "productName": "Mouse",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 500.00
    },
    {
      "productId": 8,
      "productName": "Mouse",
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 500.00
    }
  ]
}

###

### Delete basket by username
DELETE {{Basket_HostAddress}}/john_doe
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Access_Token}}

###

### Get token from keycloak
POST https://localhost:62722/realms/eshop/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=eshop-client&scope=email openid&username=test&password=1234
